    <briefdescription>
<para>Minimal key-value storage interface for custom migration callbacks. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implementations wrap the actual storage engine (e.g. RocksDBWrapper) so that custom migration lambdas remain testable without a real database. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
